|   |       |-- Different signature -> REQUEST_ID_CONFLICT
|   |       `-- Same signature -> return existing run
|   |           `-- Awaiting acknowledgement -> retry installation; never rerun model
|   |-- Capture revision-pinned inputs
|   |   |-- canvas.snapshot(target + reference revision IDs)
|   |   |   |-- Require expected document version
|   |   |   |-- Anchored target must be a diagram at the requested base revision
|   |   |   `-- Import exact revisions and their logical node identities
|   |   |-- Resolve prompt references from history, then revision registry
|   |   |   |-- Diagram reference -> pinned ASCII
