|       |-- Supplied candidate -> submitStoredDiagramEdit [D]; bypass model
|       |-- In-place edit -> one revision
|       |-- Variant edit -> revisions + validated review records
|       |   `-- Optional presentation alternatives reference those reviews
|       `-- Create -> requested count of new diagrams; extend -> one new diagram
|           `-- Extension requires origin and valid source anchors
|-- [G] generateDiagram: application-to-domain boundary
|   |-- Check cancellation and base ownership
|   |-- Clone request with authoritative nodeRefs -> DiagramGenerator.generate
|   |   `-- PiDiagramEditRuntime
|   |       |-- Render captured context, references and instruction into prompt
|   |       |-- Resolve imported agent-context sources
|   |       |-- Create session with submit_diagram_edit as its tool
|   |       |   `-- createValidatedSubmission: candidate acceptance gate
|   |       |       |-- validateGeneratedDiagramEdit
|   |       |       |   |-- Strict schema: ASCII, structure kind, ranges and mappings
|   |       |       |   |-- Enforce source-mapping option
|   |       |       |   |-- Strip continuity markers; resolve logical node correspondence
|   |       |       |   |-- Require nonempty content with spaces and LF; reject CR/tabs
|   |       |       |   `-- Build content and validate diagram
|   |       |       |       `-- Each continuity marker identifies exactly one output node
|   |       |       |-- Scoped edit -> preserve structure kind; check scoped replacements
|   |       |       |-- Invalid -> report issues, accepted=false, terminate=false
|   |       |       |   `-- Agent corrects and resubmits; rejected candidate issues no revision
|   |       |       `-- Valid -> retain candidate, accepted=true, terminate=true
|   |       |-- After prompt completes
